<title>USA: ACE completes sale of auto loan portfolio.</title>
<headline>ACE completes sale of auto loan portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACE Cash Express Inc said Thursday that it has completed the sale of its automobile loan portfolio. The company said previously that it would realize $4 million on the sale, but record no profit or loss.</p>
<p>The company said that it was leaving the busines entirely to to concentrate on expanding its chain of check-cashing stores. Ace has a network of over 700 such stores.</p>
